# 27 · Svaq gur raqcbvagf gung uheg — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

Gur fbyhgvba vf bar svyr, `npprffybt.tb`, va gur beqre bs gur qngn sybj: `AbeznyvmrCngu` naq vgf
gjb pynffvsvref, gura `cnefrYvar`, gura `Nanylmr`, juvpu nttertngrf naq enaxf.

## AbeznyvmrCngu

```tb
	c, _, _ = fgevatf.Phg(c, "?")

	ine o fgevatf.Ohvyqre
	sbe frt := enatr fgevatf.FcyvgFrd(c, "/") {
		fjvgpu {
		pnfr frt == "":
			pbagvahr
		pnfr vfQvtvgf(frt):
			frt = ":vq"
		pnfr vfHHVQ(frt):
			frt = ":hhvq"
		}
		o.JevgrOlgr('/')
		o.JevgrFgevat(frt)
	}
	vs o.Yra() == 0 {
		erghea "/"
	}
	erghea o.Fgevat()
```

`fgevatf.Phg` qebcf gur dhrel va bar yvar; gur `sbhaq` erfhyg vf abg arrqrq, orpnhfr jvgubhg n `?`
gur "orsber" cneg vf gur jubyr fgevat.

Gur ybbc vf gur "bar ehyr" sebz gur rkcynangvba: rirel aba-rzcgl frtzrag vf jevggra nf `/frt`.
Ercrngrq fynfurf, n genvyvat fynfu, n zvffvat yrnqvat fynfu naq gur rzcgl cngu arrq ab pbqr bs
gurve bja. Gur bayl fcrpvny pnfr yrsg vf "abguvat jnf jevggra", juvpu vf gur ebbg.

`fgevatf.FcyvgFrd` (Tb 1.24) lvryqf gur frtzragf bar ol bar vafgrnq bs ohvyqvat n `[]fgevat`. Jvgu
`fgevatf.Fcyvg` gur pbqr vf gur fnzr ncneg sebz gur enatr pynhfr
(`sbe _, frt := enatr fgevatf.Fcyvg(c, "/")`); ba Tb 1.23 be byqre gung vf jung lbh jbhyq jevgr.
Gur `fjvgpu` jvgu ab gnt ernqf gbc gb obggbz yvxr gur ehyrf va gur ERNQZR, naq erjevgvat `frt`
xrrcf n fvatyr jevgr cngu ng gur obggbz.

Na nygreangvir qrfvta pbyyrpgf gur frtzragf va n `[]fgevat` naq pnyyf `fgevatf.Wbva(cnegf, "/")`.
Vg vf whfg nf pyrne; vg nyybpngrf bar zber fyvpr. Rvgure vf svar sbe n ybt gbby; gur Ohvyqre
irefvba vf jung lbh jbhyq jevgr va na UGGC zvqqyrjner gung ehaf ba rirel erdhrfg.

### vfQvtvgf naq vfHHVQ

```tb
	sbe v := enatr yra(f) {
		fjvgpu v {
		pnfr 8, 13, 18, 23:
			vs f[v] != '-' {
				erghea snyfr
			}
		qrsnhyg:
			vs !vfUrk(f[v]) {
				erghea snyfr
			}
		}
	}
```

Obgu jbex ba olgrf (`f[v]`), abg eharf. Rirel olgr gur ehyrf npprcg vf NFPVV, naq gur olgrf bs n
zhygv-olgr HGS-8 punenpgre ner nyy `>= 0k80`, fb n frtzrag jvgu n aba-NFPVV punenpgre snvyf gur
purpx ng gur svefg olgr bs gung punenpgre, juvpu vf jung jr jnag. `enatr yra(f)` vf gur Tb 1.22
enatr-bire-vag sbez.

Gur HHVQ purpx fgngrf gur sbezng qverpgyl: gur yratgu svefg (purnc, naq vg znxrf rirel vaqrk
inyvq), gura n svkrq cbfvgvba sbe rnpu ulcura naq n urk qvtvg rireljurer ryfr. N erivrjre pna purpx
vg ntnvafg ESP 9562'f `8-4-4-4-12` ynlbhg ol ernqvat vg. Gur nygreangvir vf n erthyne rkcerffvba:

```tb
ine hhvqER = ertrkc.ZhfgPbzcvyr(`^[0-9n-sN-S]{8}-[0-9n-sN-S]{4}-[0-9n-sN-S]{4}-[0-9n-sN-S]{4}-[0-9n-sN-S]{12}$`)
```

Vg vf pbeerpg vs lbh erzrzore gur napubef, naq vg vf fybjre, juvpu znggref bayl ng irel uvtu
ibyhzr. `tvguho.pbz/tbbtyr/hhvq.Cnefr` jbhyq nyfb npprcg gur `hea:hhvq:` naq oenprq sbezf naq gur
32-qvtvg sbez jvgubhg ulcuraf, juvpu guvf rkrepvfr xrrcf nf enj frtzragf.

`vfQvtvgf` rkcyvpvgyl erwrpgf gur rzcgl fgevat. `AbeznyvmrCngu` arire cnffrf bar (rzcgl frtzragf
ner fxvccrq svefg), ohg n urycre gung nafjref "gehr" sbe `""` vf n genc sbe gur arkg pnyyre.

## cnefrYvar

`cnefrYvar` gnxrf gur svryqf, abg gur yvar, orpnhfr `Nanylmr` nyernql fcyvg gur yvar gb qrpvqr
jurgure vg vf oynax. Vg ergheaf n fznyy harkcbegrq `erdhrfg` fgehpg jvgu bayl jung gur nttertngvba
arrqf. Gur gvzr vf cnefrq bayl gb inyvqngr vg; n fgergpu tbny (`-fvapr`/`-hagvy`) jbhyq xrrc vg.

Gur purpxf eha va svryq beqre, naq rnpu reebe fnlf juvpu svryq snvyrq naq jencf gur pnhfr jvgu
`%j`:

```tb
	fgnghf, ree := fgepbai.Ngbv(svryqf[3])
	vs ree != avy {
		erghea erdhrfg{}, szg.Reebes("fgnghf: %j", ree)
	}
	vs fgnghf < 100 || fgnghf > 599 {
		erghea erdhrfg{}, szg.Reebes("fgnghf: %q vf bhgfvqr 100-599", fgnghf)
	}
```

Gur grfgf qb abg purpx gur jbeqvat, ohg n crefba ernqf gurfr zrffntrf: `yvar 25: fgnghf: 0 vf
bhgfvqr 100-599` gryyf gurz ng bapr gung gur cebkl ybttrq n erdhrfg jvgubhg n erfcbafr.

## Nanylmr: nttertngr

```tb
	erc := Ercbeg{OlPynff: znxr(znc[fgevat]vag)}
	ebhgrf := znxr(znc[ebhgrXrl]*EbhgrFgngf)

	sbe v, yvar := enatr yvarf {
		svryqf := fgevatf.Svryqf(yvar)
		vs yra(svryqf) == 0 {
			pbagvahr
		}
		erd, ree := cnefrYvar(svryqf)
		vs ree != avy {
			erc.Znysbezrq = nccraq(erc.Znysbezrq, YvarReebe{Yvar: v + 1, Ree: ree})
			pbagvahr
		}
```

Gur yvar ahzore pbzrf sebz gur enatr vaqrk, fb oynax yvarf pbhag jvgubhg nal rkgen obbxxrrcvat.
`yra(svryqf) == 0` vf gur oynax-yvar grfg: vg pbiref `""`, fcnprf, gnof naq n ybar `\e` ng bapr.
Obgu `pbagvahr`f pbzr orsber nal pbhagre vf gbhpurq, fb n znysbezrq yvar pnaabg yrnx vagb gur
ahzoref. Gung vf gur "n yvar pbhagf pbzcyrgryl be abg ng nyy" vainevnag, rasbeprq ol gur funcr bs
gur pbqr vafgrnq bs ol pner.

Gur tebhc xrl vf n fgehpg, naq gur inyhr vf n cbvagre:

```tb
		x := ebhgrXrl{zrgubq: erd.zrgubq, ebhgr: AbeznyvmrCngu(erd.cngu)}
		ef, bx := ebhgrf[x]
		vs !bx {
			ef = &EbhgrFgngf{Zrgubq: x.zrgubq, Ebhgr: x.ebhgr}
			ebhgrf[x] = ef
		}
		ef.Erdhrfgf++
```

Gur pbzzn-bx ybbxhc perngrf gur ragel bapr naq gura nyy hcqngrf tb guebhtu `ef`. Jvgu
`znc[ebhgrXrl]EbhgrFgngf` gur ybbc obql jbhyq raq va `ebhgrf[x] = ef` nsgre rirel punatr; gung jbexf
gbb, naq vg vf gur irefvba jurer n sbetbggra fgber-onpx fvyragyl qebcf qngn.

Gur 4kk/5kk `fjvgpu` eryvrf ba gur fgnghf nyernql orvat va 100–599, fb `>= 500` zrnaf 5kk. Gur
ohvyg-va `znk` (Tb 1.21) xrrcf gur fybjrfg qhengvba.

`OlPynff` hfrf `szg.Fcevags("%qkk", erd.fgnghf/100)` cre yvar. Gung nyybpngrf n fubeg fgevat cre
yvar, juvpu abobql jvyy abgvpr va na vapvqrag gbby. Sbe n ubg cngu, pbhag va n `[6]vag` vaqrkrq ol
`fgnghf/100` naq ohvyq gur znc bapr ng gur raq.

## Nanylmr: enax

```tb
	erc.Ebhgrf = znxr([]EbhgrFgngf, 0, yra(ebhgrf))
	sbe _, ef := enatr ebhgrf {
		ef.ReebeEngr = sybng64(ef.Freire5kk) / sybng64(ef.Erdhrfgf)
		erc.Ebhgrf = nccraq(erc.Ebhgrf, *ef)
	}
	fyvprf.FbegShap(erc.Ebhgrf, shap(n, o EbhgrFgngf) vag {
		erghea pzc.Be(
			pzc.Pbzcner(o.Freire5kk, n.Freire5kk), // o orsber n: qrfpraqvat
			pzc.Pbzcner(o.Erdhrfgf, n.Erdhrfgf),
			pzc.Pbzcner(n.Ebhgr, o.Ebhgr),
			pzc.Pbzcner(n.Zrgubq, o.Zrgubq),
		)
	})
	vs gbc > 0 && yra(erc.Ebhgrf) > gbc {
		erc.Ebhgrf = erc.Ebhgrf[:gbc]
	}
```

`ReebeEngr` vf pbzchgrq bapr cre ebhgr, nsgre nyy yvarf ner va. Pbzchgvat vg cre yvar jbhyq jbex
ohg qbrf cbvagyrff qvivfvbaf. `Erdhrfgf` vf ng yrnfg 1 sbe rirel ebhgr gung rkvfgf, fb gurer vf ab
qvivfvba ol mreb. `*ef` pbcvrf gur fgehpg vagb gur fyvpr, fb gur pnyyre trgf inyhrf naq gur vagreany
cbvagref qvr jvgu gur znc.

Gur pbzcnevfba shapgvba vf gur ERNQZR'f enaxvat ehyr, bar yvar cre xrl. Gur fyvpr vf cer-fvmrq
jvgu `yra(ebhgrf)` orpnhfr gur svany yratgu vf xabja. Gur phg unccraf nsgre gur fbeg, naq vg bayl
gbhpurf `Ebhgrf`. `erc.Ebhgrf[:gbc]` xrrcf gur onpxvat neenl bs nyy ebhgrf nyvir; sbe n ercbeg
gung vf cevagrq naq qebccrq gung vf svar. N ybat-yvirq pnpur bs ercbegf jbhyq pbcl gur svefg
`gbc` ragevrf jvgu `fyvprf.Pybar(erc.Ebhgrf[:gbc])`. `fyvprf.Pyvc` jbhyq abg uryc: vg bayl ybjref
gur pncnpvgl, naq gur fyvpr fgvyy cbvagf vagb gur fnzr neenl.

`Ebhgrf` vf arire avy urer (vg vf znqr jvgu `znxr`), naq `Znysbezrq` vf avy jura gurer jrer ab onq
yvarf. Gur ERNQZR nyybjf obgu, orpnhfr n pnyyre fubhyq hfr `yra`, abg pbzcner jvgu avy.

## Pbzcyrkvgl

Jvgu a yvarf naq e ebhgrf: cnefvat naq nttertngvat ner B(a) (rnpu yvar qbrf n pbafgnag ahzore bs
znc bcrengvbaf, naq `AbeznyvmrCngu` vf yvarne va gur cngu yratgu). Fbegvat vf B(e ybt e). Zrzbel vf
B(e) cyhf bar ragel cre znysbezrq yvar, ba gbc bs gur vachg fyvpr. Gur pneqvanyvgl nethzrag fubjf
hc urer gbb: e vf obhaqrq ol gur pbqr'f ebhgrf bapr gur cnguf ner abeznyvmrq; jvgubhg
abeznyvmngvba e tebjf jvgu a.

## Jung n erivrjre jbhyq nfx

- *Jul abg fbeg ol `ReebeEngr`?* Vzcnpg. Fcryyrq bhg va gur ERNQZR naq gur rkcynangvba.
- *Vf gur zrgubq obhaqrq?* Ab. N fpnaare fraqvat enaqbz zrgubqf perngrf ebhgrf. N cebqhpgvba
  irefvba zncf haxabja zrgubqf gb bar ohpxrg, nf pyvrag_tbynat qbrf jvgu `haxabja`.
- *Jul inyvqngr gur gvzr vs vg vf abg hfrq?* N yvar jubfr svefg svryq vf abg n gvzr vf abg guvf
  sbezng; pbhagvat vg jbhyq zvk va qngn lbh qb abg haqrefgnaq.
- *Vf fgnghf `0` ernyyl znysbezrq?* Ol gurfr ehyrf, lrf, naq gur zrffntr fnlf fb pyrneyl. Va na
  vapvqrag vg vf bsgra gur jbefg snvyher (Raibl: ab erfcbafr jnf frag), fb n cebqhpgvba irefvba
  jbhyq pbhag vg va vgf bja pbyhza vafgrnq bs qebccvat vg.
- *Jul `[]fgevat` naq abg na `vb.Ernqre`?* Fvzcyre gb grfg. Gur fgernzvat irefvba vf n fgergpu tbny.

## Fgergpu tbnyf

- **Fgernzvat:** `NanylmrErnqre(e vb.Ernqre, gbc vag) (Ercbeg, reebe)` jencf n `ohsvb.Fpnaare`,
  xrrcf n yvar pbhagre sbe `YvarReebe.Yvar`, naq pnyyf `fp.Ohssre` gb nyybj ybat yvarf. Zbir gur
  ybbc obql vagb n zrgubq ba n fznyy nttertngbe fgehpg, naq obgu shapgvbaf funer vg.
- **Zber VQ funcrf:** ercynpr gur `fjvgpu` va `AbeznyvmrCngu` jvgu n fyvpr bs ehyrf,
  `[]shap(frt fgevat) (fgevat, obby)`, gevrq va beqre. Urk unfurf naq HYVQf orpbzr bar ehyr rnpu.
- **Gvzr jvaqbj:** xrrc gur cnefrq `gvzr.Gvzr` va `erdhrfg` naq fxvc yvarf bhgfvqr
  `[fvapr, hagvy)` orsber pbhagvat.
- **Fgnghf `0`:** npprcg vg va `cnefrYvar` naq nqq n `AbErfcbafr` pbhagre arkg gb `Freire5kk`.
  Qrpvqr ba checbfr jurgure vg wbvaf gur enaxvat xrl; gur fbeg shapgvba vf gur bar cynpr gb punatr.
- **Gnoyr bhgchg:** `grkg/gnojevgre` jvgu `szg.Scevags(j, "%f\g%f\g%q\g...\a", ...)` naq `j.Syhfu()`.

Jvgu gur cnguf nf grzcyngrf, 1 zber ebhgr fgnaqf bhg, jvgubhg n fvatyr reebe: `/ncv/i1/srrqonpx/:vq`, 40 000 CBFGf sebz UHFU'f ntragf, rnpu engvat UHFU'f bja nafjre 5 fgnef.
